## Android Lifecycle & Flutter Integration

### Android Activity Lifecycle

**Lifecycle Stages:**
```
onCreate()      → Activity created, initialize UI
  ↓
onStart()       → Activity becomes visible
  ↓
onResume()      → Activity enters foreground, gains focus
  ↓
onPause()       → Activity loses focus, partially hidden
  ↓
onStop()        → Activity not visible
  ↓
onDestroy()     → Activity destroyed
```

### Lifecycle Methods Explained

**onCreate():**
- Called when activity first created
- Initialize UI components
- Restore saved state
```kotlin
